{"availability":"available","full":"Maitranya/Asha_kanini","name":"Asha_kanini","description":"Explore this public GitHub project.","category":"Other","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-19T15:57:43Z","updated":"2026-10-11T00:16:36Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://asha-kanini-mu.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://asha-kanini-mu.vercel.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T02:10:52.101Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T02:10:52.101Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T02:10:52.101Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T02:10:52.101Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Kanini Padhai (\"Kanini\" learning) is a bilingual (Tamil/English) learning-resource hub and assessment-analytics dashboard built for Asha for Education's tutoring program.","The app has two independent halves that share one codebase, one build, and one visual language:","These two halves are functionally independent — the Trail's content catalog has nothing to do with the assessment data behind Analytics — but they're built as two views of a single React app and deployed together."],"features":["The Learning Trail — a browsing tool where a teacher picks a class (1–8) and a term (I/II/III) and gets a curated list of external learning resources (videos, worksheets, games, books) per topic, in Tamil/English,…","The Analytics Dashboard — a six-tab dashboard summarizing assessment data (the \"AAA\" annual assessment) collected across Asha-supported schools: scores, oral-skill progression, and engagement with the trail itself."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Maitranya/Asha_kanini/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"e0958671a06b7837673041ea71701006a3552bafd6bd82c9cbd712453f02ba91","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T02:10:52.261Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T02:10:52.261Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Kanini Padhai (\"Kanini\" learning) is a bilingual (Tamil/English) learning-reso